<title>USA: Fed meeting begins Tuesday, decision due Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Fed meeting begins Tuesday, decision due Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve will begin its two-day policy-making on Tuesday at 1430 EST/1930 GMT, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>No announcement is expected from the central bank's Federal Open Market Committee until after it ends its meeting on Wednesday.</p>
